WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.610
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.880 --> 01:43.970
[Small Town Remedy]

3
01:44.110 --> 01:46.890
[Episode 20]

4
01:46.979 --> 01:49.289
[Surgery in Progress]

5
01:47.640 --> 01:48.479
Dr. Liu.

6
01:48.759 --> 01:50.150
I've read your resume.

7
01:49.410 --> 01:50.410
[Touch-free Faucet]

8
01:50.229 --> 01:50.789
You're excellent.

9
01:50.470 --> 01:58.880
[Surgical Hand Scrubbing and Antisepsis Procedure] [Seven-Step Handwashing Technique]

10
01:50.789 --> 01:53.200
But why do you choose to stay at Xiaoximen Hospital?

11
01:53.200 --> 01:54.200
That's personal.

12
01:56.789 --> 01:59.120
You're more of a character than they said.

13
01:59.200 --> 02:00.040
I just don't want to talk

14
02:00.040 --> 02:01.840
about things unrelated to work.

15
02:03.640 --> 02:04.870
Some small hospitals

16
02:06.510 --> 02:08.000
are kept afloat

17
02:08.000 --> 02:09.729
by just one or two good doctors.

18
02:09.800 --> 02:12.630
These hospitals need doctors

19
02:12.680 --> 02:13.400
far more than

20
02:13.400 --> 02:14.960
doctors need them.

21
02:16.840 --> 02:17.960
You are so young.

22
02:18.120 --> 02:19.190
You should think about

23
02:19.190 --> 02:20.150
your future.

24
02:21.240 --> 02:22.750
You need a bigger platform,

25
02:22.750 --> 02:24.430
not one that exploits you.

26
02:29.910 --> 02:31.770
Even the best of us make mistakes.

27
02:32.000 --> 02:33.660
Even a good horse can stumble.

28
02:38.520 --> 02:40.240
I don't know your name yet.

29
02:41.520 --> 02:42.450
Liu Zhengliang.

30
02:43.000 --> 02:43.930
Liu Zhengliang.

31
02:47.150 --> 02:49.079
Don't you hold a grudge against me?

32
02:49.750 --> 02:50.240
They say

33
02:50.240 --> 02:52.280
I pulled a knife on you that day.

34
02:52.560 --> 02:53.079
I'll have to pull a knife

35
02:53.079 --> 02:54.430
on you in a bit.

36
03:00.280 --> 03:02.710
Before, I never thought

37
03:03.680 --> 03:05.120
being a doctor or a police

38
03:05.120 --> 03:06.000
was so great.

39
03:07.470 --> 03:08.150
Aren't they all just jobs

40
03:08.150 --> 03:09.800
that put food on the table?

41
03:11.360 --> 03:12.690
That is, until I met you.

42
03:14.400 --> 03:15.120
If I were you,

43
03:15.120 --> 03:16.590
I couldn't do what you do.

44
03:17.680 --> 03:18.470
Really.

45
03:21.240 --> 03:22.030
That day,

46
03:23.079 --> 03:24.360
you said in the hall

47
03:24.710 --> 03:26.240
that you were a good doctor.

48
03:27.280 --> 03:28.360
Now I believe that.

49
03:29.870 --> 03:30.680
Thank you.

50
03:35.120 --> 03:37.450
Thank me after the surgery is successful.

51
03:37.710 --> 03:38.520
Anesthesia.

52
03:41.560 --> 03:42.360
Wait a minute.

53
03:47.079 --> 03:48.310
If I don't survive,

54
03:50.079 --> 03:52.030
please tell Su Jing

55
03:53.590 --> 03:55.280
to keep appealing.

56
03:56.470 --> 03:57.280
Don't let it affect

57
03:57.280 --> 04:00.010
our child's chances of getting a government job.

58
04:03.560 --> 04:04.710
Take a deep breath.

59
04:05.150 --> 04:06.520
With this fighting spirit,

60
04:06.520 --> 04:08.380
he'll pull through this surgery.

61
04:09.150 --> 04:10.550
He's got the will to live.

62
04:11.080 --> 04:13.280
Right temporal craniotomy completed.

63
04:15.710 --> 04:17.920
The surgical field is well exposed.

64
04:18.000 --> 04:19.070
Now we have to

65
04:19.070 --> 04:21.130
determine the boundary of the tumor.

66
04:21.339 --> 04:22.720
The boundary between the tumor and the cortex

67
04:22.720 --> 04:23.830
is hard to determine.

68
04:23.830 --> 04:24.670
So I need to

69
04:24.700 --> 04:25.800
open the cortex

70
04:26.270 --> 04:28.070
and assess the color and texture

71
04:28.680 --> 04:30.070
before I can determine the tumor's boundaries.

72
04:30.070 --> 04:31.730
That's excellent technique.

73
04:31.750 --> 04:33.950
His technique is second to none.

74
04:34.000 --> 04:34.800
Yes.

75
04:36.070 --> 04:37.390
You two, watch carefully

76
04:37.390 --> 04:38.480
and learn from this.

77
04:38.480 --> 04:41.280
You don't get opportunities like this very often.

78
04:42.070 --> 04:43.830
The tumor in the temporal lobe

79
04:43.830 --> 04:45.720
doesn't look too difficult to remove.

80
04:45.720 --> 04:47.040
Can you operate?

81
04:47.040 --> 04:48.640
No problem. I'll start then.

82
04:57.360 --> 04:58.270
The brain tissue is swelling

83
04:58.270 --> 04:59.159
too fast.

84
05:00.000 --> 05:01.070
Severe cerebral swelling.

85
05:01.070 --> 05:02.950
This is one of the most dangerous

86
05:03.000 --> 05:04.730
complications of craniotomy.

87
05:04.950 --> 05:07.410
Can you determine the cause of the swelling?

88
05:07.630 --> 05:09.560
Is it internal bleeding in the tumor,

89
05:09.560 --> 05:10.950
or something else?

90
05:11.190 --> 05:13.120
Could the old injury have started

91
05:13.120 --> 05:13.720
bleeding again?

92
05:13.720 --> 05:14.390
Impossible.

93
05:14.390 --> 05:16.190
There's no problem with the trauma.

94
05:16.190 --> 05:18.360
It looks like the draining vein was cut first,

95
05:18.360 --> 05:19.680
before the main feeding artery

96
05:19.680 --> 05:20.600
was blocked.

97
05:20.600 --> 05:21.070
Here.

98
05:21.070 --> 05:22.160
Take a piece of wet gauze

99
05:22.160 --> 05:23.160
and press it gently for me.

100
05:23.160 --> 05:24.360
Keep the brain protected for now.

101
05:24.360 --> 05:25.510
I'll find the main feeding artery

102
05:25.510 --> 05:26.190
and block it.

103
05:26.190 --> 05:27.650
Blood pressure 75 over 38.

104
05:27.950 --> 05:29.160
Give vasopressors immediately,

105
05:29.160 --> 05:30.510
and another bottle of colloid fluid.

106
05:30.510 --> 05:33.510
Contact the blood bank and prepare for a transfusion!

107
05:34.000 --> 05:34.800
Found it.

108
05:35.190 --> 05:37.190
I've found the main feeding artery.

109
05:40.480 --> 05:41.270
Okay.

110
05:42.000 --> 05:43.390
The swelling is finally going down.

111
05:43.390 --> 05:45.250
His blood pressure is stable too.

112
05:48.240 --> 05:48.920
Okay.

113
05:49.510 --> 05:51.770
Then let's continue removing the tumor.

114
05:52.810 --> 05:57.310
[Do not touch the louvers]

115
05:57.980 --> 06:01.960
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

116
06:04.310 --> 06:10.820
[Quiet]

117
06:05.310 --> 06:06.310
Du Fang's family.

118
06:07.000 --> 06:08.190
The surgery went very well.

119
06:08.190 --> 06:09.040
Don't worry.

120
06:10.040 --> 06:10.870
Thank you.

121
06:17.770 --> 06:23.210
[Kindly close the door behind you]

122
06:33.000 --> 06:33.830
I watched

123
06:34.159 --> 06:35.870
the surgery from beginning to end.

124
06:35.870 --> 06:37.470
Your skills are really good.

125
06:37.950 --> 06:39.480
Your talent is being wasted

126
06:39.480 --> 06:41.870
at Xiaoximen Hospital.

127
06:42.510 --> 06:43.750
Chief Physician Qin has her eye on you.

128
06:43.750 --> 06:45.150
She asked me to talk to you

129
06:45.360 --> 06:47.360
and see if you're willing to join us.

130
06:47.430 --> 06:49.390
Your current rank will carry over, of course,

131
06:49.390 --> 06:50.750
and your income will double.

132
06:50.750 --> 06:52.010
That's very generous.

133
06:52.480 --> 06:53.270
Qin

134
06:53.270 --> 06:54.630
is about to retire.

135
06:54.950 --> 06:56.720
Then you can handle the clinical side,

136
06:56.720 --> 06:58.000
and I'll handle the research.

137
06:58.000 --> 06:59.240
With our partnership,

138
06:59.240 --> 07:00.390
give us 3 years,

139
07:00.560 --> 07:01.870
and we'll be one of the top 3

140
07:01.870 --> 07:03.950
neurosurgery departments in the province.

141
07:03.950 --> 07:05.000
You'd never reach

142
07:05.040 --> 07:05.920
an achievement like this

143
07:05.920 --> 07:07.250
at Xiaoximen Hospital.

144
07:07.870 --> 07:08.870
What do you think?

145
07:10.750 --> 07:12.040
This offer is good.

146
07:12.630 --> 07:14.870
So you agree?

147
07:20.360 --> 07:21.360
I have a question.

148
07:22.190 --> 07:22.950
Go ahead.

149
07:23.720 --> 07:24.950
If I go there,

150
07:25.510 --> 07:27.240
which one of us will be the boss?

151
07:28.120 --> 07:29.680
I'll be the boss, of course.

152
07:30.480 --> 07:31.480
Then I won't go.

153
07:32.830 --> 07:33.630
After all, I like

154
07:33.630 --> 07:35.240
giving orders.

155
07:35.800 --> 07:36.920
Look, I just criticized you a bit.

156
07:36.920 --> 07:38.630
Why do you still hold a grudge?

157
07:39.600 --> 07:40.240
Okay.

158
07:40.240 --> 07:42.190
I'll treat you to a drink tonight, okay?

159
07:42.190 --> 07:43.920
How about you treat me instead?

160
07:45.920 --> 07:46.720
President Long.

161
07:46.720 --> 07:48.240
You're poaching my people on my turf.

162
07:48.240 --> 07:49.900
Isn't that crossing the line?

163
07:50.510 --> 07:53.710
Chief Physician Liu, someone is looking for you outside.

164
07:56.920 --> 07:57.720
President.

165
08:03.240 --> 08:04.500
Well, President Long,

166
08:05.040 --> 08:07.240
this isn't poaching.

167
08:07.720 --> 08:09.780
At most, we were just talking it over.

168
08:10.800 --> 08:11.920
Besides, I can

169
08:11.920 --> 08:14.380
wait for Chief Physician Liu to lose his job.

170
08:15.720 --> 08:17.390
I'll treat you to a drink another day,

171
08:17.390 --> 08:17.870
okay?

172
08:20.800 --> 08:21.630
If there's nothing else, President Long,

173
08:21.630 --> 08:23.190
I-I'll take my leave.

174
08:41.720 --> 08:42.650
Why are you here?

175
08:44.320 --> 08:46.600
I need to talk to you about something.

176
08:46.720 --> 08:47.600
Come with me.

177
08:48.870 --> 08:50.150
Let's have a talk.

178
08:50.960 --> 08:51.750
Okay.

179
08:52.120 --> 08:53.120
Then wait for me a sec.

180
08:53.120 --> 08:54.080
I just finished a surgery

181
08:54.080 --> 08:54.790
and need to take a shower.

182
08:54.790 --> 08:55.840
No need.

183
08:57.240 --> 08:59.040
Let's go take a shower together.

184
09:13.720 --> 09:15.750
Come down.

185
09:16.390 --> 09:20.380
[Shower]

186
09:17.750 --> 09:18.550
I haven't

187
09:18.720 --> 09:19.440
set foot in

188
09:19.440 --> 09:21.440
a public bathhouse in over 20 years.

189
09:21.480 --> 09:23.810
I'm not used to this anymore, so I'll pass.

190
09:25.150 --> 09:26.670
So you don't want

191
09:26.670 --> 09:28.600
to be naked in front of me?

192
09:29.670 --> 09:30.480
Fine.

193
09:31.910 --> 09:34.150
Clothes can cover your body,

194
09:36.390 --> 09:38.030
but you've got to open up

195
09:39.320 --> 09:40.750
to me here.

196
09:43.750 --> 09:45.870
The heart is responsible for pumping blood.

197
09:45.870 --> 09:46.630
If I open it up

198
09:46.630 --> 09:47.360
to you,

199
09:47.360 --> 09:48.480
I'll die.

200
09:50.750 --> 09:52.630
Playing dumb with me, huh?

201
09:53.200 --> 09:55.130
Believe it or not, I'll beat you up.

202
10:01.390 --> 10:03.200
Come on, come down.

203
10:04.320 --> 10:05.650
Just a foot soak is fine.

204
10:06.510 --> 10:07.720
Then we can

205
10:09.360 --> 10:10.870
at least say

206
10:11.390 --> 10:13.120
we've soaked our feet

207
10:13.120 --> 10:14.750
in the same pool.

208
10:16.870 --> 10:18.530
I might like you a little more.

209
10:36.840 --> 10:38.770
What exactly do you want to tell me?

210
10:39.030 --> 10:41.360
Scrub my back later.

211
10:42.270 --> 10:43.930
I've said what I needed to say.

212
10:46.150 --> 10:47.480
Figure it out yourself.

213
10:53.600 --> 10:54.660
Learn from Ai Chen.

214
10:55.670 --> 10:57.270
Try opening your heart.

215
11:12.510 --> 11:13.440
Why are you here?

216
11:14.840 --> 11:16.200
You came back just in time.

217
11:16.200 --> 11:17.440
It's almost heated up.

218
11:17.440 --> 11:17.870
What is it?

219
11:17.870 --> 11:19.550
My mom stewed two pork joints today.

220
11:19.550 --> 11:21.550
She asked me to bring one for you two.

221
11:21.670 --> 11:23.390
She also made dumplings. Look.

222
11:23.390 --> 11:24.120
It smells so good.

223
11:24.120 --> 11:25.840
Of course.

224
11:26.480 --> 11:27.270
Do you know

225
11:27.270 --> 11:28.930
what Zhengguang just told me?

226
11:29.670 --> 11:30.550
What did he say?

227
11:30.600 --> 11:32.260
He said he's going to Beijing.

228
11:32.630 --> 11:33.390
Careful, it's hot.

229
11:33.390 --> 11:34.030
It's fine.

230
11:35.390 --> 11:36.670
He's leaving tomorrow.

231
11:36.670 --> 11:37.670
He already bought the ticket.

232
11:37.670 --> 11:38.390
Tomorrow?

233
11:38.390 --> 11:39.240
Exactly.

234
11:39.600 --> 11:40.550
That's too sudden.

235
11:40.550 --> 11:41.480
Go ask him.

236
11:42.030 --> 11:42.960
Ask him.

237
11:48.270 --> 11:49.200
Liu Zhengguang.

238
11:50.150 --> 11:52.030
You're going to Beijing tomorrow?

239
11:52.030 --> 11:53.890
Why didn't you discuss it with me?

240
11:54.150 --> 11:55.750
It's my life. I'll make my own decisions.

241
11:55.750 --> 11:57.080
I don't need to discuss it with you.

242
11:57.080 --> 11:58.740
What are you even deciding on?

243
11:59.120 --> 11:59.720
Didn't you just get a job

244
11:59.720 --> 12:00.850
at a massage parlor?

245
12:01.200 --> 12:03.510
The salary is too low. There's no future.

246
12:03.910 --> 12:05.510
I don't want to do it anymore.

247
12:05.840 --> 12:07.390
I've only been back for a few days,

248
12:07.390 --> 12:08.270
and now you're leaving already?

249
12:08.270 --> 12:08.870
Didn't we agree

250
12:08.870 --> 12:10.200
to spend some time together?

251
12:10.200 --> 12:11.400
That's what you said.

252
12:11.510 --> 12:12.840
Didn't you also say

253
12:13.030 --> 12:15.090
you'd support me no matter what I did?

254
12:17.000 --> 12:17.840
Yes.

255
12:18.030 --> 12:19.000
I did say that.

256
12:19.390 --> 12:22.000
He has said a lot of things.

257
12:22.600 --> 12:24.750
You don't listen to everything he says.

258
12:24.750 --> 12:26.360
You said you needed some time to figure things out,

259
12:26.360 --> 12:27.030
right?

260
12:27.270 --> 12:28.510
It's only been two months.

261
12:28.510 --> 12:29.510
And you're ready?

262
12:30.200 --> 12:31.120
No.

263
12:31.960 --> 12:33.290
But I've figured it out.

264
12:33.550 --> 12:34.440
If I never take the first step,

265
12:34.440 --> 12:35.600
I'll never be ready.

266
12:35.600 --> 12:36.120
Don't act like

267
12:36.120 --> 12:37.270
you're so brave.

268
12:37.270 --> 12:39.000
Have you thought this through?

269
12:39.320 --> 12:40.480
I have no degree,

270
12:40.510 --> 12:41.510
no background,

271
12:41.510 --> 12:42.510
and no money.

272
12:42.750 --> 12:44.270
I've only got two things going for me:

273
12:44.270 --> 12:45.270
courage

274
12:45.600 --> 12:46.550
and youth.

275
12:47.030 --> 12:47.840
But

276
12:48.320 --> 12:50.150
both of those

277
12:50.150 --> 12:51.320
will fade with time,

278
12:53.120 --> 12:54.320
until I truly have nothing.

279
12:54.320 --> 12:54.960
Come on.

280
12:54.960 --> 12:56.080
Save that crap.

281
12:56.750 --> 12:58.240
Y-Your relatives,

282
12:58.270 --> 13:00.270
friends, and home are all here.

283
13:00.630 --> 13:01.480
And you're going to Beijing?

284
13:01.480 --> 13:02.840
That's what it means to have nothing.

285
13:02.840 --> 13:03.600
Get it?

286
13:04.440 --> 13:05.240
Right?

287
13:06.320 --> 13:07.360
Speak.

288
13:11.550 --> 13:13.550
Have you really thought it through?

289
13:13.960 --> 13:14.870
I have.

290
13:15.270 --> 13:16.230
I didn't I tell you

291
13:16.230 --> 13:17.030
in advance

292
13:17.080 --> 13:17.750
because I knew

293
13:17.750 --> 13:18.240
you'd

294
13:18.240 --> 13:19.640
react exactly like this.

295
13:32.670 --> 13:33.910
I'll sell this house,

296
13:35.670 --> 13:37.330
and you can keep all the money.

297
13:39.910 --> 13:40.790
Plus the cash

298
13:40.790 --> 13:42.120
Mom left behind.

299
13:42.360 --> 13:43.440
You can use it

300
13:43.440 --> 13:44.900
to get started in Beijing.

301
13:45.750 --> 13:46.550
Do you remember

302
13:46.550 --> 13:47.550
what I told you

303
13:47.550 --> 13:48.810
when I first came back?

304
13:49.670 --> 13:50.480
I said,

305
13:50.840 --> 13:52.510
I'm your big brother,

306
13:53.080 --> 13:54.080
so it's

307
13:54.080 --> 13:55.030
my job

308
13:55.030 --> 13:56.030
to look after you.

309
13:56.510 --> 13:57.270
Since I said it,

310
13:57.270 --> 13:58.390
I have to do it.

311
13:58.640 --> 13:59.150
Liu Zhengliang.

312
13:59.150 --> 13:59.910
And

313
14:00.360 --> 14:01.820
I agree with what you said.

314
14:02.510 --> 14:03.360
Indeed.

315
14:04.150 --> 14:07.680
If you don't take a shot now, you'll be too old before you know it.

316
14:09.960 --> 14:10.960
So just go.

317
14:11.630 --> 14:12.870
What's the big deal?

318
14:12.910 --> 14:14.080
If you can't make it, just come back.

319
14:14.080 --> 14:15.010
Liu Zhengliang.

320
14:15.440 --> 14:16.230
Easy.

321
14:17.120 --> 14:17.980
How about this?

322
14:19.030 --> 14:20.090
Tomorrow morning,

323
14:20.120 --> 14:21.840
I'll go to the real estate agency.

324
14:21.840 --> 14:22.570
Zhengliang.

325
14:22.630 --> 14:23.890
I know you're touched.

326
14:26.080 --> 14:27.750
I also think I'm pretty great.

327
14:27.790 --> 14:28.550
No, Zhengliang.

328
14:28.550 --> 14:29.880
Stop talking nonsense.

329
14:30.320 --> 14:31.200
Hurry up and pack.

330
14:31.200 --> 14:32.110
There's no time. Let's go.

331
14:32.110 --> 14:33.040
Liu Zhengliang.

332
14:33.630 --> 14:34.790
I mean,

333
14:34.790 --> 14:35.390
you don't have to

334
14:35.390 --> 14:36.870
sell the house over this.

335
14:42.670 --> 14:43.960
You don't need to walk me out.

336
14:43.960 --> 14:45.120
I didn't plan to.

337
14:45.150 --> 14:46.670
Just wanted to tell you something.

338
14:46.670 --> 14:48.960
Your dad came to see me a couple of days ago.

339
14:48.960 --> 14:49.750
For what?

340
14:51.240 --> 14:52.910
He dragged me off to the bathhouse

341
14:52.910 --> 14:55.570
and said something that didn't make much sense.

342
14:55.630 --> 14:56.360
Whatever he said to you,

343
14:56.360 --> 14:57.670
don't take it to heart.

344
14:58.790 --> 14:59.960
I'll ask him later.

345
15:00.120 --> 15:01.550
No need. Don't ask him.

346
15:01.750 --> 15:03.350
I just wanted to let you know.

347
15:04.910 --> 15:05.720
What's wrong?

348
15:05.790 --> 15:06.920
You're still angry?

349
15:07.550 --> 15:10.350
There's nothing wrong with what Zhengguang said.

350
15:11.440 --> 15:12.840
I'm not angry at Zhengguang.

351
15:12.840 --> 15:14.360
Then who are you angry at?

352
15:14.360 --> 15:15.390
Me?

353
15:16.910 --> 15:18.750
I'm not angry at anyone.

354
15:20.080 --> 15:21.750
I'm just mad at the Northeast.

355
15:26.360 --> 15:28.630
Were we born in the Northeast

356
15:28.630 --> 15:30.200
just to leave it behind?

357
15:31.270 --> 15:33.030
I've seen many people leave,

358
15:33.670 --> 15:36.150
and I've helped many return to their roots.

359
15:36.840 --> 15:38.000
But I just don't get it.

360
15:38.000 --> 15:39.240
Are they all afraid of the cold,

361
15:39.240 --> 15:40.840
or are they allergic to snow?

362
15:41.790 --> 15:43.550
Winters in the Northeast are cold,

363
15:43.550 --> 15:45.550
but the people are warm.

364
15:48.270 --> 15:50.730
Is the outside world really that wonderful?

365
15:53.840 --> 15:56.300
Will leaving the Northeast make them happy?

366
15:56.870 --> 15:58.510
Don't they miss home?

367
16:03.320 --> 16:04.750
I've been out there,

368
16:05.510 --> 16:07.320
but what's good or bad depends on how you look at it.

369
16:07.320 --> 16:09.320
Everyone has different standards.

370
16:09.910 --> 16:11.790
Whether the outside world is good or not—

371
16:11.790 --> 16:12.920
I can't answer that.

372
16:13.960 --> 16:14.750
But I can answer

373
16:14.750 --> 16:15.880
your last question.

374
16:18.320 --> 16:19.320
They miss home.

375
16:20.750 --> 16:22.550
From the day they leave home

376
16:23.670 --> 16:24.750
to the day

377
16:24.750 --> 16:25.950
they finally return.

378
16:32.390 --> 16:33.920
Your luggage is all packed?

379
16:34.600 --> 16:35.790
You...

380
16:35.870 --> 16:36.910
You've got a lot going for you.

381
16:36.910 --> 16:38.150
You're just too impulsive.

382
16:38.150 --> 16:40.000
You just do whatever pops into your head

383
16:40.000 --> 16:41.270
and now take off on a whim.

384
16:41.270 --> 16:42.960
We just started to get along.

385
16:43.200 --> 16:44.330
Wait till I get back.

386
16:45.080 --> 16:46.390
By the time I come back,

387
16:46.390 --> 16:47.360
I'll probably be rolling in money.

388
16:47.360 --> 16:48.290
By then, I'll...

389
16:50.600 --> 16:51.790
Slow down.

390
16:51.840 --> 16:53.390
And you said I'm impulsive.

391
16:54.720 --> 16:55.600
When I come back,

392
16:55.600 --> 16:56.480
I'll have this shop of yours

393
16:56.480 --> 16:57.120
renovated.

394
16:57.120 --> 16:58.030
And I'll invest in you.

395
16:58.030 --> 16:59.790
Come on.

396
17:00.240 --> 17:02.320
Just make sure you don't starve out there.

397
17:02.320 --> 17:04.200
And you want to invest in me?

398
17:07.310 --> 17:08.109
Take this.

399
17:09.270 --> 17:10.440
I can't take this.

400
17:10.720 --> 17:12.240
You don't want your pay?

401
17:12.270 --> 17:14.109
I only worked for six days this month.

402
17:14.109 --> 17:15.200
So what if it's six days?

403
17:14.569 --> 17:17.750
[Gong's Blind Massage]

404
17:15.440 --> 17:16.160
Take it.

405
17:16.790 --> 17:17.829
The extra

406
17:18.000 --> 17:19.069
is to help you out.

407
17:20.380 --> 17:21.680
You need money when you're traveling.

408
17:21.680 --> 17:22.510
Take it, kid.

409
17:24.200 --> 17:24.960
Thank you.

410
17:24.960 --> 17:25.960
Don't mention it.

411
17:27.310 --> 17:28.109
Zhengguang.

412
17:28.480 --> 17:29.880
Sweetie, careful.

413
17:32.880 --> 17:34.590
Why are you here?

414
17:34.720 --> 17:35.550
You guys are making

415
17:35.550 --> 17:36.550
such a fuss over me leaving.

416
17:36.550 --> 17:37.880
I'm not used to all this.

417
17:38.000 --> 17:39.830
Good luck. Have a safe trip.

418
17:44.000 --> 17:44.720
Got it.

419
17:48.240 --> 17:49.240
I... I'm leaving.

420
17:51.790 --> 17:52.790
I'll walk you out.

421
18:09.510 --> 18:11.750
Hope you find someone special soon.

422
18:12.720 --> 18:15.780
Consider this my contribution to your future wedding.

423
18:16.070 --> 18:17.000
Take care.

424
18:18.400 --> 18:19.160
Zhengguang.

425
18:19.160 --> 18:20.200
If you can't make it out there,

426
18:20.200 --> 18:21.240
just come back.

427
18:21.510 --> 18:22.240
Okay.

428
18:33.920 --> 18:34.920
Do you have to go?

429
18:35.480 --> 18:36.440
I have to.

430
18:37.200 --> 18:39.200
Only by leaving can I make big money.

431
18:39.400 --> 18:40.590
You never used to be so obsessed

432
18:40.590 --> 18:41.590
with money.

433
18:42.400 --> 18:44.330
Didn't you say that was in the past?

434
18:44.720 --> 18:46.160
People change.

435
18:49.720 --> 18:51.720
Are you leaving because of Gong Xue?

436
18:53.310 --> 18:54.240
What do you mean?

437
18:57.350 --> 19:00.150
You want to make money to pay for her eye treatment.

438
19:01.110 --> 19:05.620
[Parking lot]

439
19:01.510 --> 19:04.000
I make money for myself first.

440
19:04.070 --> 19:05.000
Enjoying life

441
19:05.000 --> 19:06.160
is what matters most.

442
19:06.160 --> 19:08.220
It has nothing to do with anyone else.

443
19:12.030 --> 19:14.040
[Parking lot]

444
19:16.070 --> 19:18.030
So you're leaving because of me?

445
19:20.310 --> 19:21.110
Exactly.

446
19:21.790 --> 19:22.920
Now you're talking.

447
19:23.200 --> 19:24.030
Look, here's the thing.

448
19:24.030 --> 19:25.290
We're buddies, right?

449
19:26.070 --> 19:27.480
I'll go to Beijing and see what I can make of it.

450
19:27.480 --> 19:28.680
Once I make it big,

451
19:28.790 --> 19:31.120
I'll come back and help you make money too.

452
19:31.790 --> 19:32.880
Zhengguang, I...

453
19:32.880 --> 19:33.590
Okay, okay.

454
19:34.400 --> 19:35.730
Come on, enough of that.

455
19:35.790 --> 19:36.550
You're a grown man.

456
19:36.550 --> 19:37.680
Don't get all mushy.

457
19:39.350 --> 19:41.200
My friend at the crematorium

458
19:41.200 --> 19:42.160
told me

459
19:42.200 --> 19:44.330
that they're hiring a night watchman.

460
19:44.920 --> 19:46.830
The job also involves helping carry bodies.

461
19:46.830 --> 19:47.590
The pay is good.

462
19:47.590 --> 19:49.160
Aren't you looking for a job?

463
19:49.160 --> 19:51.070
If you're not afraid, why not give it a try?

464
19:51.070 --> 19:51.930
The pay is good.

465
19:52.880 --> 19:53.880
I'm not afraid.

466
19:56.030 --> 19:57.680
Let's both do our best.

467
19:58.640 --> 19:59.570
Let's make it big

468
19:59.720 --> 20:00.680
and give the people

469
20:00.680 --> 20:02.010
around us a better life.

470
20:07.240 --> 20:08.030
I'm leaving.

471
20:08.640 --> 20:09.400
Zhengguang.

472
20:11.880 --> 20:13.830
Didn't you say you had surgery today?

473
20:13.830 --> 20:15.070
Aren't you leaving?

474
20:15.440 --> 20:17.170
I rushed over as fast as I could.

475
20:17.400 --> 20:17.830
Let's go.

476
20:17.830 --> 20:19.400
There's time to see you in.

477
20:20.240 --> 20:21.070
Did you bring your ID?

478
20:21.070 --> 20:22.400
I brought it. I had to.

479
20:22.400 --> 20:23.030
If I hadn't brought it,

480
20:23.030 --> 20:24.240
I'd have just drawn a fake one

481
20:24.240 --> 20:25.070
and snuck in.

482
20:26.350 --> 20:27.480
I'm leaving. Go back.

483
20:27.480 --> 20:29.280
Take care of yourself out there.

484
20:37.470 --> 20:39.610
[Bus Terminal]

485
20:39.010 --> 20:42.160
♪ A soul that came to earth amid the cries ♪

486
20:42.750 --> 20:45.860
♪ Welcome to this city of haste ♪

487
20:46.390 --> 20:48.580
♪ Grow taller, quick as you can ♪

488
20:46.720 --> 20:47.920
Where's Zhengguang?

489
20:48.000 --> 20:48.790
Over there.

490
20:48.990 --> 20:51.340
♪ Learn how to find your footing ♪

491
20:49.440 --> 20:50.880
Didn't you say you weren't coming?

492
20:50.880 --> 20:52.200
You also said you weren't coming.

493
20:52.200 --> 20:53.000
Zhengguang.

494
20:53.580 --> 20:56.850
♪ A soul who hid among the lanes and alleys ♪

495
20:53.680 --> 20:54.440
Zhengguang!

496
20:54.880 --> 20:55.680
Here.

497
20:55.750 --> 20:56.480
That ID from before

498
20:56.480 --> 20:57.270
is with me.

499
20:57.270 --> 20:59.030
Pocket it. It might be useful.

500
20:57.330 --> 21:00.450
♪ A single turn, and the lamp at the door grows distant ♪

501
20:59.440 --> 21:00.240
I know.

502
21:00.240 --> 21:01.270
Chen, you keep it.

503
21:00.930 --> 21:03.300
♪ The ticket bears no way back ♪

504
21:01.590 --> 21:02.270
I will never

505
21:02.270 --> 21:03.240
lose my ID again.

506
21:03.390 --> 21:03.870
[Phone Charging Station]

507
21:03.630 --> 21:06.010
♪ How like life it is ♪

508
21:04.280 --> 21:08.030
[Phone Charging Station]

509
21:06.880 --> 21:07.480
Hello?

510
21:08.280 --> 21:11.530
♪ One who was stranded on the road ♪

511
21:08.440 --> 21:10.640
Speak slowly. I can't hear you clearly.

512
21:11.750 --> 21:12.550
What's wrong?

513
21:11.940 --> 21:15.070
♪ Heels buried under unseen snow ♪

514
21:14.240 --> 21:15.030
Bye-bye!

515
21:15.560 --> 21:17.800
♪ Don't panic—the journey is long ♪

516
21:18.170 --> 21:20.690
♪ Long enough to hold your pause ♪

517
21:23.580 --> 21:25.950
♪ The wind in the city ♪

518
21:26.330 --> 21:29.080
♪ Blows through dreams that flicker between light and dark ♪

519
21:29.860 --> 21:32.600
♪ Blows through one soul's radiance ♪

520
21:34.060 --> 21:36.810
♪ And all its weathered scars ♪

521
21:37.930 --> 21:40.480
♪ Blows through the depths of winter ♪

522
21:40.790 --> 21:43.590
♪ Stumbling along in the wind ♪

523
21:44.710 --> 21:47.270
♪ Flickering along in the wind ♪

524
21:48.850 --> 21:54.720
♪ Toward the crossroads brimming with sunlight ♪

525
21:53.360 --> 21:55.680
[Kindly close the door behind you]

526
21:58.270 --> 21:59.530
What's the situation?

527
21:59.790 --> 22:01.200
The heart failure is too severe.

528
22:01.200 --> 22:01.880
In the ICU,

529
22:01.880 --> 22:03.030
he might last 7 or 8 days.

530
22:03.030 --> 22:04.830
But if he leaves, he won't last half a day.

531
22:04.830 --> 22:06.760
How could this happen so suddenly?

532
22:07.160 --> 22:08.830
Chief Physician Qin has checked on him.

533
22:08.830 --> 22:09.680
It's likely that the patient

534
22:09.680 --> 22:10.880
already had underlying

535
22:10.880 --> 22:12.310
cardiovascular disease.

536
22:12.310 --> 22:14.840
After the surgery, his body was under stress.

537
22:14.920 --> 22:15.790
Fluctuations in blood pressure

538
22:15.790 --> 22:17.270
or abnormal blood clotting

539
22:16.000 --> 22:24.690
[Equipment Room]

540
22:17.270 --> 22:19.310
may have triggered a massive myocardial infarction.

541
22:19.310 --> 22:21.000
No one could have done anything.

542
22:21.000 --> 22:21.720
Alright,

543
22:21.720 --> 22:23.180
it's not our fault either.

544
22:23.200 --> 22:24.830
Why are you even bringing up fault right now?

545
22:24.830 --> 22:26.360
Can you not be so emotional?

546
22:27.000 --> 22:27.860
It's just fate.

547
22:28.550 --> 22:29.350
We are doctors,

548
22:29.350 --> 22:30.440
not the Almighty.

549
22:29.610 --> 22:33.180
[Equipment Room]

550
22:31.750 --> 22:33.030
He's not even 30.

551
22:33.750 --> 22:35.810
The surgery was clearly successful.

552
22:37.750 --> 22:38.480
You should

553
22:38.790 --> 22:39.440
think about

554
22:39.440 --> 22:40.830
how to tell his family.

555
22:43.480 --> 22:44.040
Yesterday he said

556
22:44.040 --> 22:46.480
he wanted to eat Eight-Treasure Pork Trotters.

557
22:46.480 --> 22:48.010
He asked me to buy it for him.

558
22:49.640 --> 22:50.440
I figured that stuff

559
22:50.440 --> 22:51.550
was too greasy,

560
22:51.830 --> 22:53.230
so I didn't get it for him.

561
22:54.680 --> 22:57.280
I said he could have it after he was discharged.

562
22:59.110 --> 23:01.110
How could he be doing so badly today?

563
23:04.550 --> 23:06.270
He even apologized to me.

564
23:07.000 --> 23:09.440
He said he didn't know why he got sick before,

565
23:09.440 --> 23:11.100
and his temper got really bad.

566
23:14.200 --> 23:15.000
But after the surgery,

567
23:15.000 --> 23:16.270
he felt different.

568
23:17.590 --> 23:18.920
Maybe he was cured.

569
23:22.640 --> 23:23.440
Doctor.

570
23:26.310 --> 23:27.770
Wasn't he getting better?

571
23:32.960 --> 23:33.750
I'm sorry.

572
23:34.440 --> 23:35.840
We really tried our best.

573
23:36.550 --> 23:37.070
How much does the ICU cost

574
23:37.070 --> 23:38.350
per day?

575
23:40.070 --> 23:41.550
Even at Xiaoximen Hospital,

576
23:41.550 --> 23:43.210
it's at least 5,000 to 10,000.

577
23:45.240 --> 23:46.440
Even in the ICU,

578
23:46.440 --> 23:47.900
he won't last much longer.

579
23:48.920 --> 23:50.160
And besides, this expense

580
23:50.160 --> 23:51.880
isn't covered by our agreement.

581
23:51.880 --> 23:52.590
Our team

582
23:52.590 --> 23:53.920
can't afford this.

583
23:57.030 --> 23:58.510
Can we try again?

584
23:58.830 --> 24:00.230
Think of something else?

585
24:14.380 --> 24:17.070
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

586
24:18.270 --> 24:19.070
Okay.

587
24:20.440 --> 24:21.440
I know.

588
24:25.000 --> 24:26.310
I'll go borrow money.

589
24:27.480 --> 24:29.610
Can you keep him going a little longer?

590
24:32.880 --> 24:33.680
Ms. Su,

591
24:35.270 --> 24:36.030
we completely understand

592
24:36.030 --> 24:37.720
how you feel.

593
24:38.200 --> 24:39.860
But we need to make this clear.

594
24:40.030 --> 24:41.360
This isn't about money.

595
24:41.880 --> 24:42.640
The patient already has

596
24:42.640 --> 24:43.310
a consciousness disorder.

597
24:43.310 --> 24:44.790
He might never pull through.

598
24:44.790 --> 24:45.920
You don't need to...

599
24:45.920 --> 24:48.160
Alright, say no more!

600
24:50.200 --> 24:52.270
I understand everything.

601
24:56.310 --> 24:57.030
Okay.

602
24:58.110 --> 24:59.680
Let me say one last thing.

603
25:02.440 --> 25:04.100
You're raising a child alone.

604
25:04.200 --> 25:05.270
You can't ruin

605
25:05.270 --> 25:06.470
your future for this.

606
25:10.310 --> 25:11.440
Go borrow the money.

607
25:13.000 --> 25:14.260
I'll keep an eye on him.

608
25:14.830 --> 25:16.070
If he regains consciousness,

609
25:16.070 --> 25:17.730
I'll notify you immediately.

610
25:21.070 --> 25:22.720
Thank you, Dr. Liu.

611
25:23.440 --> 25:25.170
I'll go borrow money right now.

612
25:25.920 --> 25:27.310
I'll be right back.

613
25:30.880 --> 25:31.750
Are you people at Xiaoximen Hospital

614
25:31.750 --> 25:33.210
that desperate for money?

615
25:33.400 --> 25:33.550
Well.

616
25:33.550 --> 25:35.350
Don't you know her situation?

617
25:36.720 --> 25:37.720
You'd stoop to making money off this, too?

618
25:37.720 --> 25:39.320
The decision is hers to make.

619
25:42.020 --> 25:47.300
[Quiet] [Non-Smoking Ward]

620
25:56.550 --> 25:57.410
I'll take over.

621
25:57.750 --> 25:59.750
Someone is looking for you outside.

622
26:03.750 --> 26:05.200
Aren't the patients in the ICU

623
26:05.200 --> 26:07.480
supposed to be under their care?

624
26:08.270 --> 26:10.600
Why are you the one watching him every day?

625
26:11.200 --> 26:13.550
Isn't there a rumor that the hospital is shutting down?

626
26:13.550 --> 26:15.610
Many people have resigned recently.

627
26:16.310 --> 26:17.160
Besides,

628
26:17.160 --> 26:18.360
Du Fang is different.

629
26:20.830 --> 26:23.360
Is Xiaoximen Hospital really going to close?

630
26:25.590 --> 26:26.590
Not necessarily.

631
26:26.680 --> 26:27.480
Right?

632
26:28.240 --> 26:29.160
I think so too.

633
26:29.720 --> 26:30.720
A man like President Long

634
26:30.720 --> 26:32.510
is so calculating.

635
26:33.310 --> 26:34.110
Wouldn't he leave himself

636
26:34.110 --> 26:35.370
a way out or something?

637
26:36.880 --> 26:38.590
Why don't you go and sound him out?

638
26:38.590 --> 26:39.790
It won't do any good.

639
26:39.880 --> 26:40.960
I can't change anything.

640
26:40.960 --> 26:41.690
That's true.

641
26:41.790 --> 26:44.000
There's Sichuan pepper on that shrimp ball.

642
26:44.000 --> 26:45.070
Pick it out.

643
26:51.720 --> 26:52.790
Is it good?

644
26:55.880 --> 26:56.510
Not bad.

645
26:57.110 --> 26:57.960
When it comes to cooking,

646
26:57.960 --> 26:59.680
I'm pretty confident.

647
27:00.510 --> 27:02.570
Otherwise, how could I have grown up?

648
27:05.550 --> 27:06.880
Do you know why the characters for "grow up"

649
27:06.880 --> 27:08.640
don't have radicals?

650
27:10.480 --> 27:11.740
You don't know, do you?

651
27:12.350 --> 27:14.030
Because you have to rely on yourself.

652
27:14.030 --> 27:16.490
You have to rely on yourself for everything.

653
27:18.680 --> 27:19.640
I almost forgot.

654
27:19.880 --> 27:20.590
When we were kids,

655
27:20.590 --> 27:22.550
neither of us had our parents around.

656
27:22.550 --> 27:24.210
So we had to rely on ourselves.

657
27:24.440 --> 27:26.030
We had to be self-reliant since childhood,

658
27:26.030 --> 27:26.680
persevere,

659
27:26.680 --> 27:28.480
and one day we'll accumulate enough strength

660
27:28.480 --> 27:29.480
to make everyone

661
27:29.480 --> 27:30.810
look at us with new eyes.

662
27:36.790 --> 27:37.720
Listening to the broadcast wasn't in vain.

663
27:37.720 --> 27:38.440
I can tell.

664
27:38.640 --> 27:39.440
I'm so eloquent.

665
27:39.440 --> 27:41.570
Call Su Jing quickly. Du Fang is awake.

666
28:04.510 --> 28:05.240
Hurry.

667
28:05.310 --> 28:06.710
You don't have much time.

668
28:08.510 --> 28:09.240
Let's go.

669
28:08.920 --> 28:09.280
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

670
28:09.660 --> 28:10.570
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

671
28:16.270 --> 28:17.000
Du Fang.

672
28:17.550 --> 28:18.750
Du Fang, look.

673
28:18.920 --> 28:20.520
I brought our daughter here.

674
28:23.440 --> 28:24.160
Du Fang.

675
28:25.480 --> 28:26.350
Look.

676
28:41.200 --> 28:50.640
