678
29:08.480 --> 29:10.590
Du Fang, what do you want to do?

679
29:19.350 --> 29:19.880
Come on.

680
29:20.400 --> 29:21.680
Talk to your dad.

681
29:22.640 --> 29:25.310
Dad, I miss you.

682
29:30.830 --> 29:32.150
Dad misses you too.

683
29:32.240 --> 29:33.550
Quick, call Dad.

684
29:34.400 --> 29:35.240
Dad.

685
29:55.030 --> 29:55.750
Du Fang.

686
29:56.590 --> 29:57.310
Du Fang.

687
29:58.590 --> 29:59.480
Du Fang!

688
29:59.640 --> 30:01.200
Open your eyes and look!

689
30:01.830 --> 30:03.880
I brought our daughter to see you!

690
30:05.640 --> 30:06.590
Du Fang!

691
30:06.520 --> 30:08.940
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

692
30:07.400 --> 30:08.960
Open your eyes and look!

693
30:09.480 --> 30:11.750
I brought our child to see you!

694
30:14.200 --> 30:15.480
Du Fang!

695
30:16.270 --> 30:18.110
Open your eyes.

696
30:24.240 --> 30:25.920
The police have reopened the investigation

697
30:25.020 --> 30:28.730
[Welcome to Fangyuan Hotel]

698
30:26.590 --> 30:28.720
