699
30:28.810 --> 30:29.440
[Open]

700
30:29.160 --> 30:31.400
The child will be able to hold her head high in the future.

701
30:29.720 --> 30:36.680
[Welcome to Fangyuan Hotel]

702
30:32.070 --> 30:32.880
This

703
30:32.880 --> 30:34.550
