705
30:35.720 --> 30:37.270
Everyone there chipped in for you.

706
30:37.270 --> 30:37.830
Don't worry.

707
30:37.830 --> 30:39.350
Everyone did it voluntarily.

708
30:39.350 --> 30:40.160
Take it.

709
30:41.240 --> 30:42.440
How can I accept this?

710
30:42.720 --> 30:43.780
You have to take it.

711
30:44.270 --> 30:45.510
It's their way of showing they care,

712
30:45.510 --> 30:46.270
