717
30:54.680 --> 30:55.790
All the funeral expenses,

718
30:55.790 --> 30:57.200
plus the restaurant bill,

719
30:57.200 --> 30:58.550
came to 4,580 altogether,

720
30:58.550 --> 30:58.960
right?

721
30:58.960 --> 30:59.640
Right.

722
30:59.790 --> 31:00.750
Dr. Liu

723
31:00.750 --> 31:02.550
