731
31:16.440 --> 31:17.750
I want peace of mind.

732
31:19.070 --> 31:20.510
As a doctor,

733
31:22.310 --> 31:24.070
attending a patient's funeral

734
31:25.270 --> 31:27.200
really makes me feel bad.

735
31:30.750 --> 31:32.350
He doesn't have any relatives or friends.

736
31:32.350 --> 31:33.680
If we didn't come,

737
31:34.070 --> 31:35.670
