738
31:37.550 --> 31:38.610
I gave it all to her.

739
31:47.880 --> 31:50.010
Thank you all so much for coming today,

740
31:50.680 --> 31:52.480
especially you, Dr. Liu.

741
31:55.480 --> 31:56.670
Everyone told me

742
31:56.790 --> 31:57.680
not to put my Du Fang

743
31:57.680 --> 31:58.720
