749
32:12.790 --> 32:14.000
You understood me.

750
32:14.720 --> 32:16.980
You stayed by his side for me for two days.

751
32:18.510 --> 32:21.270
Even if he

752
32:21.400 --> 32:23.160
only woke up for a few minutes,

753
32:24.720 --> 32:25.510
at least my daughter and I

754
32:25.510 --> 32:27.510
got to talk to him for a little while.

755
32:27.830 --> 32:28.750
Now I know

756
32:30.510 --> 32:32.240
he won't be making that journey

757
32:32.960 --> 32:34.000
