758
32:36.880 --> 32:39.010
And I no longer have to worry about him.

759
32:41.640 --> 32:42.720
From now on,

760
32:43.350 --> 32:45.240
I'll raise my child

761
32:46.070 --> 32:47.530
and make a good life for us.

762
32:50.680 --> 32:51.880
Thank you, everyone.

763
33:06.670 --> 33:10.420
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

764
33:10.480 --> 33:14.150
[Hospital Admission Registration] [Accessible Route]

765
33:14.180 --> 33:18.070
[Emergency]

766
33:36.480 --> 33:38.740
There really aren't many patients, huh?

767
33:41.480 --> 33:42.720
