774
33:54.160 --> 33:56.310
I just came from the office.

775
33:56.310 --> 33:58.710
Where's Mingming? Does she have a surgery?

776
33:59.400 --> 34:01.070
Listen to the question you're asking.

777
34:01.070 --> 34:02.530
You just said it yourself.

778
34:03.030 --> 34:04.960
Our hospital is about to shut down.

779
34:05.350 --> 34:06.310
There are no patients.

780
34:06.310 --> 34:08.170
How could there be any surgeries?

781
34:08.550 --> 34:09.550
Mingming went to the provincial capital

782
34:09.550 --> 34:11.679
on a business trip with the president.

783
34:12.480 --> 34:14.190
What kind of business trip are they on?

784
34:14.190 --> 34:15.280
Who knows?

785
34:15.280 --> 34:16.810
Call and ask them yourself.

786
34:17.280 --> 34:22.389
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

787
34:17.969 --> 34:19.070
We'll know

788
34:19.070 --> 34:19.920
