789
34:19.920 --> 34:21.110
Why bother calling?

790
34:22.460 --> 34:24.610
[120]

791
34:24.800 --> 34:25.610
[120; Emergency Rescue]

792
34:25.639 --> 34:26.889
[Fucheng Emergency Medical Rescue Center]

793
34:27.880 --> 34:29.110
Her finger got crushed off by a machine.

794
34:29.110 --> 34:29.920
Did they bring the severed finger?

795
34:29.920 --> 34:30.670
It's inside.

796
34:30.670 --> 34:31.150
Notify Orthopedics.

797
34:31.150 --> 34:31.840
Have them prepare immediately

798
34:31.840 --> 34:32.880
