801
34:34.070 --> 34:34.360
Okay.

802
34:34.360 --> 34:35.800
Make sure you thoroughly clean the wounds.

803
34:35.800 --> 34:36.150
Give her

804
34:36.150 --> 34:37.280
a thorough full-body examination.

805
34:37.280 --> 34:37.670
Okay, okay.

806
34:37.670 --> 34:38.320
Let's go.

807
34:38.800 --> 34:40.710
What's your problem? Is this really necessary?

808
34:40.710 --> 34:41.800
These are the two patients

809
34:41.800 --> 34:42.760
-I just told you about. -Don't get worked up.

810
34:42.760 --> 34:44.550
One has a severed left index finger.

811
34:44.550 --> 34:45.179
The severed finger

812
34:45.179 --> 34:46.760
is preserved in the transport container.

813
34:46.760 --> 34:47.670
This patient has

814
34:47.670 --> 34:48.920
a stab wound to the left forearm

815
34:48.920 --> 34:50.320
and another to the thigh.

816
34:51.400 --> 34:52.360
I'm not seriously hurt.

817
34:52.360 --> 34:54.290
They're just superficial wounds.

818
34:54.510 --> 34:56.150
I gave you a checkup.

819
34:57.000 --> 34:58.320
Of these two wounds,

820
34:59.880 --> 35:01.920
this one here on your leg

821
35:02.360 --> 35:03.760
is a little more serious.

822
35:04.110 --> 35:06.190
It's about 2.5 centimeters deep.

823
35:07.190 --> 35:08.710
But it hasn't hit any

824
35:08.710 --> 35:10.000
major blood vessels.

825
35:10.030 --> 35:11.710
I'll give it a quick treatment.

826
35:11.710 --> 35:13.480
No wonder it doesn't hurt.

827
35:14.480 --> 35:15.710
All right. Take it down a notch.

828
35:15.710 --> 35:17.030
It'll hurt tonight.

829
35:19.070 --> 35:20.530
Why were you two fighting?

830
35:21.630 --> 35:23.440
We were both tricked by the same jerk.

831
35:23.440 --> 35:24.840
We're both victims here.

832
35:25.070 --> 35:27.190
Can you swear you haven't been seeing Zang Tian?

833
35:27.190 --> 35:27.880
You homewrecker!

834
35:27.880 --> 35:28.510
Who are you calling that?

835
35:28.510 --> 35:29.150
Come on.

836
35:29.320 --> 35:30.150
So what if I am?

837
35:30.150 --> 35:30.840
Homewrecker!

838
35:30.840 --> 35:31.800
You tramp!

839
35:34.230 --> 35:35.090
Stop fighting!

840
35:35.400 --> 35:36.710
Then why were you two fighting?

841
35:36.710 --> 35:38.640
You should've gone after that guy!

842
35:39.550 --> 35:40.840
You're right.

843
35:42.550 --> 35:43.440
I'll find someone

844
35:43.440 --> 35:44.840
to teach Zang Tian a lesson.

845
35:44.840 --> 35:45.710
That's enough.

846
35:45.960 --> 35:47.840
I'm not telling you to go around hitting people.

847
35:47.840 --> 35:49.920
You're young. You should obey the law.

848
35:49.920 --> 35:50.800
I'm not that young.

849
35:50.800 --> 35:51.920
I'm already 19.

850
35:53.710 --> 35:55.510
Look at my new hair color.

851
35:56.070 --> 35:57.000
Isn't it trendy?

852
35:58.400 --> 35:59.280
Trendy

853
35:59.880 --> 36:02.410
is about the most outdated word you could use.

854
36:03.280 --> 36:04.110
Doctor,

855
36:05.280 --> 36:06.630
has anyone ever told you

856
36:06.670 --> 36:07.630
you're kind of handsome?

857
36:07.630 --> 36:08.400
That's enough.

858
36:08.400 --> 36:09.760
I've treated both

859
36:09.760 --> 36:10.670
of your wounds.

860
36:11.110 --> 36:12.670
If you feel any discomfort,

861
36:12.670 --> 36:13.670
let me know.

862
36:14.550 --> 36:15.760
But I noticed some blood

863
36:15.760 --> 36:16.510
on your underwear.

864
36:16.510 --> 36:17.800
Wait until she takes it off, then examine her.

865
36:17.800 --> 36:18.550
Okay.

866
36:18.760 --> 36:20.110
I'm fine. Really.

867
36:20.550 --> 36:21.480
There's no need.

868
36:22.190 --> 36:23.360
It's just from getting scraped

869
36:23.360 --> 36:24.280
during the fight.

870
36:24.280 --> 36:26.480
All right, I'll go get your prescription.

871
36:26.480 --> 36:27.710
Get dressed quickly.

872
36:28.070 --> 36:28.880
Doctor.

873
36:30.480 --> 36:32.030
Could you check on

874
36:32.510 --> 36:34.030
Xu Ling for me?

875
36:34.110 --> 36:34.960
The girl who was just

876
36:34.960 --> 36:36.280
fighting with me.

877
36:41.800 --> 36:43.800
Can my finger really be reattached?

878
36:44.960 --> 36:45.760
Yes, it can.

879
36:47.710 --> 36:49.110
If you can't reattach it,

880
36:49.510 --> 36:51.480
can I at least get a discount on manicures in the future?

881
36:51.480 --> 36:53.080
You're still joking around?

882
36:53.190 --> 36:54.280
You've got a pretty positive attitude.

883
36:54.280 --> 36:56.480
No problem. You'll definitely be fine.

884
37:06.230 --> 37:07.190
How's it going?

885
37:08.190 --> 37:09.440
The tendons have been sutured.

886
37:09.440 --> 37:11.970
We're preparing to suture the blood vessels.

887
37:12.150 --> 37:13.070
That was fast.

888
37:13.800 --> 37:16.000
Dr. Zhong's skills are decent enough.

889
37:16.710 --> 37:18.510
What do you mean, "decent enough"?

890
37:18.510 --> 37:20.170
Let me translate that for you.

891
37:20.880 --> 37:22.280
He's complimenting you.

892
37:22.670 --> 37:24.530
Is that how he gives compliments?

893
37:24.590 --> 37:26.320
Shu Ran asked me to check on you.

894
37:26.710 --> 37:27.670
Is she okay?

895
37:27.760 --> 37:28.960
Her injuries are all minor.

896
37:28.960 --> 37:30.760
Relax. Don't worry.

897
37:30.760 --> 37:31.710
That's good.

898
37:32.710 --> 37:33.550
That's good.

899
37:35.500 --> 37:39.100
[Fucheng Bank]

900
37:35.800 --> 37:37.880
We're from Dongdaqiao Police Station.

901
37:37.880 --> 37:38.670
Did you just receive

902
37:38.670 --> 37:40.270
two girls who were fighting?

903
37:40.360 --> 37:41.420
Take me to see them.

904
37:42.920 --> 37:43.590
This way.

905
37:54.710 --> 37:55.510
Um...

906
37:55.510 --> 37:56.440
You can wait

907
37:56.440 --> 37:57.150
outside for now.

908
37:57.150 --> 37:57.800
Okay.

909
37:59.550 --> 38:01.280
Have you changed your clothes?

910
38:02.840 --> 38:03.760
You can't sleep here.

911
38:03.760 --> 38:04.490
Wake up.

912
38:08.030 --> 38:08.800
Wake up.

913
38:09.880 --> 38:10.670
Shu Ran.

914
38:11.360 --> 38:12.320
Shu Ran, wake up!

915
38:18.670 --> 38:19.400
Doctor!

916
38:19.400 --> 38:20.110
Shu Ran.

917
38:19.550 --> 38:20.120
[Kindly close the door behind you]

918
38:20.510 --> 38:22.630
-Blood pressure, 70 over 40. -Shu Ran!

919
38:22.630 --> 38:24.430
Dr. Liu, the scan results are in.

920
38:26.150 --> 38:27.230
The CT scan shows

921
38:27.230 --> 38:28.510
massive internal bleeding in the abdomen.

922
38:28.510 --> 38:29.510
She's blood type B.

923
38:29.510 --> 38:30.000
Prepare four units of

924
38:30.000 --> 38:31.840
B-positive red blood cells immediately.

925
38:31.840 --> 38:32.150
Hurry!

926
38:32.150 --> 38:32.920
Blood pressure, 50 over 30.

927
38:32.920 --> 38:33.840
It's dropping too fast.

928
38:33.840 --> 38:34.800
Run the IV fluids at full speed.

929
38:34.800 --> 38:35.840
200 milligrams of dopamine.

930
38:35.840 --> 38:36.510
Got it.

931
38:40.150 --> 38:42.410
The patient has no pulse or respiration.

932
38:43.230 --> 38:43.920
Start CPR!

933
38:43.920 --> 38:44.510
Hurry!

934
38:46.440 --> 38:47.480
One milligram of epinephrine.

935
38:47.480 --> 38:47.760
Push it now.

936
38:47.760 --> 38:48.030
Got it.

937
38:48.030 --> 38:50.230
One milligram of epinephrine, IV push.

938
39:07.070 --> 39:07.930
Administered.

939
39:22.070 --> 39:24.130
One stab wound to the right upper arm.

940
39:25.550 --> 39:27.360
Bruising on the right forearm,

941
39:27.960 --> 39:29.360
0.5 by 0.8 centimeters.

942
39:37.760 --> 39:39.090
Has her family arrived?

943
39:39.840 --> 39:40.630
Not yet.

944
39:40.880 --> 39:41.510
Her teacher said

945
39:41.510 --> 39:43.370
none of her family lives locally.

946
39:48.910 --> 39:53.660
[Autopsy Area]

947
39:50.110 --> 39:51.510
The cause of death was

948
39:51.760 --> 39:53.800
a ruptured abdominal iliac artery.

949
39:54.480 --> 39:55.440
Two centimeters

950
39:55.440 --> 39:56.710
above the clitoris,

951
39:56.920 --> 39:59.380
there was a small hole made by a screwdriver.

952
40:00.150 --> 40:01.550
It penetrated from here,

953
40:01.880 --> 40:04.010
piercing the uterus and iliac artery.

954
40:04.230 --> 40:05.960
If you'd examined her private parts,

955
40:05.960 --> 40:06.590
she might have been saved.

956
40:06.590 --> 40:07.230
Yes.

957
40:08.070 --> 40:09.480
All the other injuries were minor.

958
40:09.480 --> 40:11.140
This was the only fatal wound.

959
40:11.230 --> 40:12.630
The screwdriver went in at an angle.

960
40:12.630 --> 40:14.150
It just happened to hit the wrong spot.

961
40:14.150 --> 40:15.230
It went right through the ligament...

962
40:15.230 --> 40:16.630
Tell me what happened.

963
40:17.480 --> 40:18.670
Didn't I tell you to

964
40:18.670 --> 40:20.710
examine her whole body thoroughly?

965
40:21.480 --> 40:22.280
Thank you.

966
40:23.030 --> 40:25.030
I did examine her thoroughly.

967
40:25.710 --> 40:27.400
When I was dressing her wounds,

968
40:27.400 --> 40:29.480
I noticed blood on her underwear.

969
40:30.510 --> 40:31.670
I even asked her

970
40:32.190 --> 40:34.110
if she felt any discomfort.

971
40:34.480 --> 40:36.190
There was a female nurse nearby

972
40:36.190 --> 40:37.720
who could've examined her.

973
40:38.280 --> 40:39.480
She said she was fine,

974
40:40.440 --> 40:41.230
so I...

975
40:41.630 --> 40:43.090
So you didn't examine her.

976
40:43.590 --> 40:44.590
She was a girl.

977
40:44.590 --> 40:46.150
I... I'm a man, aren't I?

978
40:46.150 --> 40:47.360
I couldn't force her to...

979
40:47.360 --> 40:48.550
She was a girl.

980
40:50.480 --> 40:51.590
And you're a man.

981
40:51.080 --> 40:56.110
[Autopsy Area]

982
40:51.590 --> 40:52.630
You just didn't have the nerve

983
40:52.630 --> 40:54.630
to ask her to take off her underwear.

984
40:55.400 --> 40:57.460
Were you just too embarrassed to ask?

985
40:59.590 --> 41:00.670
What do you do?

986
41:03.260 --> 41:11.040
[Autopsy Area]

987
41:03.800 --> 41:04.730
You're a doctor.

988
41:05.880 --> 41:08.340
Does gender matter when treating a patient?

989
41:10.630 --> 41:12.710
Does gender matter when treating a patient?

990
41:12.710 --> 41:13.590
Does it?

991
41:13.590 --> 41:14.320
Chief Physician Tong.

992
41:14.320 --> 41:15.230
One tiny hole,

993
41:15.230 --> 41:16.630
and a life is lost.

994
41:17.150 --> 41:18.360
It's not just one life.

995
41:18.360 --> 41:19.360
An entire family

996
41:19.670 --> 41:20.710
and even the girl who stabbed her

997
41:20.710 --> 41:22.840
will have their lives ruined forever.

998
41:23.510 --> 41:24.400
Chief Physician Tong.

999
41:24.400 --> 41:25.860
That's not entirely fair.

1000
41:26.360 --> 41:27.560
What about you, then?

1001
41:27.670 --> 41:28.590
If a patient clearly tells you

1002
41:28.590 --> 41:30.030
she doesn't want to take off her underwear,

1003
41:30.030 --> 41:30.440
what would you do?

1004
41:30.440 --> 41:33.100
Could you ask the patient to sign a consent form?

1005
41:33.280 --> 41:34.070
Could you?

1006
41:35.590 --> 41:38.250
Could you double-check with her several times?

1007
41:38.760 --> 41:39.480
Could you?

1008
41:40.590 --> 41:41.450
What about him?

